{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1781568000, "end_date": 1782172799, "month_true_total": 94, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:05:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "228605224", "author": {"steamid": "76561198375976984", "personaname": "Morty", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/OGMorty/", "num_games_owned": 306, "num_reviews": 72, "playtime_forever": 716, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 716, "last_played": 1782170294, "avatar": "40e134611e809e213b0a0d69b7125b9754993ec1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Shooter. Great Graphics, & Story is good kind of. I mean, It is a SE Game so its not story rich but does have a plot to it. Ending could've been better but we get what we get so its fine. Enjoyed it, Had Fun!, Great Stealth (Which i love in some Shooters) & Hope we get another SE game. Pick this up if you enjoy Shooters or 3rd Person Shooters, Mainly Sniping & Stealth. No Crashes, No Bugs & A couple visual glitches (Same Glitch). Like the end of the gun sometimes breaking through the wall & appearing on the other end but nothing Bad. Not very short if the game is spaced out. Recommend 9/10.", "timestamp_created": 1782171347, "timestamp_updated": 1782171347, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.521144270896911621", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228587232", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148252822", "personaname": "Barthas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Barrthas/", "num_games_owned": 175, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4483, "last_played": 1782149511, "avatar": "3730452a9a7f7c8b70f92504ec055588fd025c0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sniper Elite: Resistance feels more like a large expansion for Sniper Elite 5 than a standalone game. \nThe campaign puts players in the role of Harry Hawker and, honestly, I hope Rebellion never lets whoever wrote some of his dialogue do it again. Hawker is one of the blandest protagonists in the series, and very little about him makes him memorable. \n\nUnfortunately, Resistance inherits almost all of the problems that plagued Sniper Elite 5. The AI remains weak, the sniping mechanics are still oversimplified, and many of the design decisions that disappointed fans of earlier entries are still present. \n\nThe one area where I think the developers listened to player feedback is map design. The maps generally offer more opportunities for long-range engagements and provide better sniper positions than many of the locations in Sniper Elite 5. For a game called Sniper Elite, that is a welcome improvement. \nSadly, that is where most of the positives end. At its core, Resistance is the same game as Sniper Elite 5. It reuses the same mechanics, the same formula, and many of the same flaws while charging a price that is difficult to justify.\n\nIf you were disappointed by Sniper Elite 5, Resistance is unlikely to change your mind. If you enjoyed Sniper Elite 5, you may find some value here, but I would still recommend waiting for a significant discount.\n\nIn my opinion, Resistance should have been a DLC rather than a standalone release.", "timestamp_created": 1782153196, "timestamp_updated": 1782153196, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502074658870697021", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228585707", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985076429", "personaname": "Achitore", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197985076429/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 1876, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1065, "last_played": 1783106958, "avatar": "bb0a3f11709d71a6e0982bf085b1ba4e472d6878"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'd wait until this game is at 60% or more off. It is ok, but a little short IMHO.", "timestamp_created": 1782151784, "timestamp_updated": 1782151784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16318", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700K CPU @ 3.60GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060", "vram_size": 12115}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228576865", "author": {"steamid": "76561198341388000", "personaname": "Just end trashbag.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198341388000/", "num_games_owned": 169, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 1413, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1413, "last_played": 1782142837, "avatar": "6256d0e53df506d4e8ed6f0bd78777ae31bcccf9"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"Blessed be the Lord my strength which teacheth my hands to war, and my fingers to fight.\"\n\nPsalm 144:2", "timestamp_created": 1782143438, "timestamp_updated": 1782143438, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "228574251", "author": {"steamid": "765